    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29138" root="عسلج" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَسَلَّجٌ</span></b> , applied to food (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَعَام</span>), <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَقِيقٌ</span> [app.
meaning <i>Thin,</i> or <i>unsubstantial</i>], (Ibn-'Abbád, O,
K,) i. e. <i>in which are flour and water:</i> (Ibn-
'Abbád, O:) or <i>good, sweet,</i> or <i>pleasant.</i> (O, K.)

